{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"hechang-e-4ab3df0c88551ae761b8","title":"袁绍南侵招郡赵俨劝李通缓户调","accounts":[{"id":"hechang-a-4ab3df0c88551ae761b8","label":"正文","text":"袁绍南侵招郡赵俨劝李通缓户调","evidence":["hechang-q-1740026fae8f7e4ba612"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0052","role":"遣使招诱","evidence":["hechang-q-1740026fae8f7e4ba612"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0016","role":"劝缓户调","evidence":["hechang-q-1740026fae8f7e4ba612"]},{"person":"lizang-p0046","role":"议征调","evidence":["hechang-q-1740026fae8f7e4ba612"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["hechang-q-1740026fae8f7e4ba612"]},"ordering_evidence":"hechang-q-1740026fae8f7e4ba612","order":4779}],"persons":[{"id":"lizang-p0046","name":"李通（字文达）","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0016","name":"赵俨","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0052","name":"袁绍","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"hechang-q-1740026fae8f7e4ba612","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-f48d8f541b52dafbaa79","layer":"original","quote":"时袁绍举兵南侵，遣使招诱豫州诸郡，诸郡多受其命。惟阳安郡不动〖6〗，而都尉李通急录户调〖7〗。俨见通曰：“方今天下未集〖8〗，诸郡并叛；怀附者，复收其绵绢；小人乐乱，能无遗恨？且远近多虞，不可不详也。”通曰：“（绍与大将军）〔公与袁绍〕相持甚急，左右郡县背叛乃尔。若绵绢不调送，观听者必谓我顾望，有所须待也〖9〗。”俨曰：“诚亦如君虑，然当权其轻重；小缓调〖10〗，当为君释此患。”","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":249,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":191,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
